[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25320.27, "timestamp": "07:02:00", "text": "击中他，但雷昂，但雷昂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25321.99, "timestamp": "07:02:01", "text": "那东西肯定在那儿，它在地上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25323.59, "timestamp": "07:02:03", "text": "B 现在会有保护装置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25325.75, "timestamp": "07:02:05", "text": "对，我们必须摧毁Gen，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25327.708, "timestamp": "07:02:07", "text": "所以我的意思是，它们就像花朵一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25329.59, "timestamp": "07:02:09", "text": "你只需单击一下就能把它弄坏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25331.59, "timestamp": "07:02:11", "text": "过了一段时间后，它就只会生成笼子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25333.23, "timestamp": "07:02:13", "text": "对，所以我们必须打破牢笼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25336.31, "timestamp": "07:02:16", "text": "然后是花，即使那样的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25337.91, "timestamp": "07:02:17", "text": "boss正在攻击你，你只需要扔出去就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25339.75, "timestamp": "07:02:19", "text": "三叉戟和B，你就不会输"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25343.11, "timestamp": "07:02:23", "text": "说实话，很多健康问题都得到了解决。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25346.388, "timestamp": "07:02:26", "text": "用三叉戟的话，确实没那么难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25348.51, "timestamp": "07:02:28", "text": "说实话，我两次都扮演过他，我喜欢他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25349.99, "timestamp": "07:02:29", "text": "好吧，第一次的时候我就想，好吧，你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25352.19, "timestamp": "07:02:32", "text": "什么？我们打败B队，为什么不呢？我喜欢我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25354.67, "timestamp": "07:02:34", "text": "其次，我只是想说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25358.548, "timestamp": "07:02:38", "text": "好的，这是什么意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25364.948, "timestamp": "07:02:44", "text": "让我轻松点，现在有两个了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25368.31, "timestamp": "07:02:48", "text": "团体右虚空T恤没有呃混乱主题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25372.43, "timestamp": "07:02:52", "text": "还有那个低沉的主题，所以你觉得他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25376.23, "timestamp": "07:02:56", "text": "会破坏我们的基地或做任何不正当的事情"}]